Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 16:47:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix: Sidebar filters (month/project) now actually filter
 Dashboard + Records list

- Dashboard (Index.tsx): reads ?month= & ?project= URL params from Sidebar
  filters (URL is source of truth when present, falls back to localStorage)
- Added project selector to Dashboard header, synced with Sidebar
- Dashboard project filter uses rec.project_id matching PROJECTS ids
- Compliance Radar hides when filters are active
- RecordListPage: added missing Project dropdown (handleProjectChange was dead code)
- Fixed TDZ bug: sectionFormCodes moved before timelineData useMemo
---
